  "description": "The Rover Pro is a step-over, full-suspension e-bike built for everyday comfort and all-terrain confidence. Its 750W (95 Nm) rear-hub motor with a torque sensor delivers smooth, proportional power, while the 52V 15Ah battery supports up to 62 miles per charge. 26×4.0″ puncture-resistant fat tires, 180 mm hydraulic brakes, and tuned front/rear suspension keep rides stable, cushioned, and in control—on city streets or gravel paths—at speeds up to 28 mph.\nQuick highlights\n\nFull suspension + 26×4.0″ fat tires = calmer, more comfortable rides.\n\n750W (95 Nm) hub motor with torque sensor for intuitive assist.\n\n52V 15Ah battery for up to 62 miles range.\n\nHydraulic disc brakes (180 mm) for confident stopping.\n\nTop speed up to 28 mph;\n\n350 lbs payload.",
